      "comment": "PAW IRULAN (7) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Filled a minor placings again last time when second (30.68) at this track making it three placings in a row. Can find winning form. HOLDEN BALE (4) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at this track over 525m behind Point Break (30.41) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Worth following up. CUMULATE (1) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 6th at Healesville following on from a win (19.00) there the start prior. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FLEEING (8) has claims if he runs up to his best.",
